This is an example based on some real data for two wells,
BonnieHouse and BonnieHut. There are realistic levels
of noise in this case. Note the multi-start global 
optimisation possibility

To perform the centered extractions:

% waveletExtractor BonnieHousePlusBonnieHut.xml --dump-ML-parameters --dump-ML-synthetics --dump-ML-wavelets --fake-Vs -v 4 --constrain-peak-arrival 0 1 -c -NLR

% A more exhaustive global optimization might be...

% waveletExtractor BonnieHousePlusBonnieHut.xml --dump-ML-parameters --dump-ML-synthetics --dump-ML-wavelets --fake-Vs -v 3 --constrain-peak-arrival 0 1 -c --multi-start -NLR
